This is the most important part of the application.

Implement an explicit per-document permission model.

Permission levels:

READ:
- View document metadata.
- Preview document.
- Download document.

EDIT:
- All READ capabilities.
- Edit permitted metadata.
- Upload a new document version.

OWNER:
